{"ticker":"ETR","updated":"2026-10-23T22:56:42Z","profile":{"longName":"Entergy Corporation","shortName":"Entergy Corporation","sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Regulated Electric","country":"United States","website":"https://www.entergy.com","fullTimeEmployees":12000,"marketCap":51284631552,"trailingPE":27.452684,"forwardPE":21.02941,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.8038695,"pegRatio":1.66,"targetMeanPrice":119.95238,"targetHighPrice":131.0,"targetLowPrice":91.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":21,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.059,"earningsGrowth":-0.019,"grossMargins":0.47000998,"operatingMargins":0.24458,"profitMargins":0.13329001,"totalRevenue":13482226688,"beta":0.448,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":118.45,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":90.87,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.37},"summary":"Entergy Corporation, together with its subsidiaries, engages in the production and retail distribution of electricity in the United States. It generates, transmits, distributes, and sells electric power in portions of Arkansas, Louisiana, Mississippi, and Texas, including the City of New Orleans. It also engages in the ownership of interests in non-nuclear power plants that sell electric power to wholesale customers, as well as provides decommissioning services to other nuclear power plant owners. It generates electricity through gas, nuclear, coal, hydro, and solar power sources. The company sells energy to retail power providers, utilities, electric power co-operatives, power trading organizations, and other power generation companies. The company's power plants have approximately 25,000 megawatts of electric generating capacity. It delivers electricity to 3.1 million utility customers in Arkansas, Louisiana, Mississippi, and Texas. Entergy Corporation was founded in 1913 and is headquartered in New Orleans, Louisiana.","summary_zh":"Entergy Corporation 及其子公司在美國從事電力生產和零售業務。它在阿肯色州、路易斯安那州、密西西比州和德克薩斯州的部分地區（包括新奧爾良市）生產、傳輸、分配和銷售電力。它還擁有非核電廠的權益，向批發客戶出售電力，並為其他核電廠所有者提供退役服務。它透過天然氣、核能、煤炭、水力和太陽能發電。該公司向零售電力供應商、公用事業公司、電力合作社、電力交易組織和其他發電公司銷售能源。該公司的發電廠擁有約25,000兆瓦的發電能力。它為阿肯色州、路易斯安那州、密西西比州和德克薩斯州的 310 萬公用事業客戶提供電力。 Entergy Corporation 成立於 1913 年，總部位於路易斯安那州新奧爾良。","sector_zh":"公用事業","industry_zh":"公用事業 - 受監管的電力","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":89.03,"h":89.7,"l":89.0,"c":89.17,"v":1540000},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":89.26,"h":89.86,"l":88.64,"c":89.59,"v":3385600},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":89.54,"h":90.0,"l":88.84,"c":89.55,"v":1632200},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":89.3,"h":89.69,"l":87.85,"c":88.13,"v":5441200},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":88.26,"h":88.69,"l":87.86,"c":88.09,"v":1705100},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":87.63,"h":88.07,"l":86.89,"c":87.41,"v":1727800},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":87.04,"h":87.64,"l":86.71,"c":87.2,"v":1626600},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":88.78,"h":89.6,"l":87.45,"c":88.18,"v":3500000},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":88.32,"h":88.56,"l":86.81,"c":87.75,"v":1952000},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":87.69,"h":88.0,"l":86.4,"c":86.83,"v":3264500},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":86.7,"h":87.47,"l":86.49,"c":87.01,"v":1936700},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":86.9,"h":88.52,"l":86.9,"c":88.44,"v":2756700},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":88.65,"h":89.94,"l":88.37,"c":89.86,"v":2366000},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":89.73,"h":90.74,"l":89.73,"c":90.29,"v":2082800},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":90.17,"h":90.7,"l":89.99,"c":90.19,"v":2062300},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":90.19,"h":90.46,"l":88.17,"c":88.26,"v":1967600},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":88.45,"h":88.85,"l":87.93,"c":88.18,"v":2936800},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":87.9,"h":88.57,"l":87.38,"c":87.83,"v":2464900},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":88.52,"h":89.28,"l":87.69,"c":88.67,"v":4786600},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":88.66,"h":89.41,"l":88.06,"c":89.24,"v":2325200},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":89.25,"h":90.98,"l":88.9,"c":90.85,"v":2134400},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":91.43,"h":91.74,"l":90.73,"c":91.59,"v":2524500},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":91.25,"h":91.67,"l":90.21,"c":90.33,"v":2869700},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":90.82,"h":92.29,"l":90.48,"c":92.25,"v":2670900},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":92.45,"h":93.81,"l":91.9,