nsas, Louisiana, Mississippi, and Texas, as follows:","zh":null},{"en":"Prior to the sale of the Entergy New Orleans and Entergy Louisiana natural gas distribution businesses on July 1, 2025, Entergy New Orleans and Entergy Louisiana provided both retail electric and gas service to customers. See \"Dispositions - Natural Gas Distribution Businesses\" in Note 14 to the financial statements for discussion of the sale of the Entergy New Orleans and Entergy Louisiana natural gas distribution businesses.","zh":null}],"competition":[],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Electricity Us Regulated","val":12775314000,"zh":"Electricity Us Regulated"},{"name":"Natural Gas Us Regulated","val":112607000,"zh":"Natural Gas Us Regulated"},{"name":"Product & Service Other","val":58765000,"zh":"Product & Service Other"}],"total":12946686000}},"peers":["FE","EIX","DTE","EXC","PEG"]}}